    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, keep in touch. Let me know if catch wind of anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just press the third button. Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmm? Dr. {@nickname}?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's Amiya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "She went to the slums.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You actually let her go alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Whatever, at least someone is protecting her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose you wouldn't be able to do anything even if you went with her. I'll let you off the hook this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you also come back by yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Penguin Logistics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You also need to take better precautions to stay safe. We won't always have the luxury of reliable local guides.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya will not be in Lungmen for a long time, since she has other missions to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll have to face her again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If I were you, I'd make sure to tell her the things that I couldn't say before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_m",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you waiting for me this whole time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry to have kept you waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? My complexion looks different from when I left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some things happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel like...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps Madam Ch'en has her own way of looking at things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though her words are harsh, and she has done things that I can't accept...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... the difference between us isn't that big.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "She has her responsibilities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... I understand now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "She also has her share of burdens to bear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps I also...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya, you also have plenty of responsibilities yourself.;...",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... just didn't have other choices.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "At least you saw your choices through.;...",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I suppose all these consequences were the results of my persistence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, there's no need... to try to comfort me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I'm well aware of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I don't know, is how long we have to keep going before this world begins to change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, what I do know for sure...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that I won't give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll always bear the consequences of my actions, because... I chose this path.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you... stay by my side?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though... this guilt will always stay with me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The regret of not being able to bring everyone with me. The regret of not being able to save my friends...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I must face reality.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "With everyone in Rhodes Island...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? A message from Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit? Did you need something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, I've received communications from a few recon teams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation has changed for the worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, I'll be right there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
